		(property "Description" "A mast as one device: IND is the mast's indication (the rule name), for drivers that take a whole mast, e.g. Driver-JMRI-SignalMast. Value = the trackplan mast's Value (836NAB, 774SAB): one Mast per trackplan mast, each protecting its own route; the head casts hang on IND."
